# MASTER PROJECT DEVELOPMENT PROMPT — SECURECROSS V2.0

## 1. Project Identity

**Project Name:** SecureCross

**Project Title:** AI-Powered Real-Time Cross-Branch Identity Verification and Secure Cash Withdrawal Authorization

**Project Type:** Full-stack banking technology prototype with biometric-verification integration and transaction-security controls.

**Primary Objective:**

Develop a complete, functional, security-focused application that demonstrates how an eligible banking customer who does not have their physical debit card available could request a cash withdrawal at a non-home branch.

The application must verify the customer's identity through live face verification, liveness detection and additional biometric verification within the same verification stage. It must then perform a real-time identity check through a simulated home-branch authentication service, execute transaction-security checks and authorize or reject the withdrawal request.

The prototype must be designed with future integration into bank-approved infrastructure in mind.

**Important:** This is an academic prototype. Do not connect to real bank accounts, production banking APIs or real customer biometric databases without explicit authorization.

